        "text": "<p><math alttext=\"2 left parenthesis x plus 7 right parenthesis equals y\"><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi></math></p>\n<p><math alttext=\"y equals x minus 3\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></math></p>"
