    "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"y equals 9 x plus 12\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>9</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mn>12</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"x plus 7 y equals 20\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>7</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>20</mn>\n</mrow></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The solution to the given system of equations is <math alttext=\"left parenthesis x comma y right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>. What is the value of <math alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi></math>?</p>",
    "type": "grid-in",
    "correctAnswer": "3",
    "explanation": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The correct answer is <math alttext=\"3\"><mn>3</mn></math>. It&rsquo;s given that <math alttext=\"y equals 9 x plus 12\"><mrow>\n<mi>y</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mn>9</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n<mo>+</mo>\n<mn>12</mn>\n</mrow>\n</mrow></math>. Substituting <math alttext=\"9 x plus 12\"><mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mn>9</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n<mo>+</mo>\n<mn>12</mn>\n</mrow></math> for <math alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi></math> in the second equation in the system, <math alttext=\"x plus 7 y equals 20\"><mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mo>+</mo>\n<mrow>\n<mn>7</mn>\n<mi>y</mi>\n</mrow>\n</mrow>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>20</mn>\n</mrow></math>, yields <math alttext=\"x plus 7 left parenthesis 9 x plus 12 right parenthesis equals 20\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></math>, which gives <math alttext=\"x plus 63 x plus 84 equals 20\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>63</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>84</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></math>, or <math alttext=\"64 x plus 84 equals 20\"><mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mn>64</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n<mo>+</mo>\n<mn>84</mn>\n</mrow>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>20</mn>\n</mrow></math>. Subtracting <math alttext=\"84\"><mn>84</mn></math> from each side of this equation yields <math alttext=\"64 x equals negative 64\"><mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mn>64</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mrow>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mn>64</mn>\n</mrow>\n</mrow></math>. Dividing each side of this equation by <math alttext=\"64\"><mn>64</mn></math> yields <math alttext=\"x equals negative 1\"><mrow>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mrow>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mn>1</mn>\n</mrow>\n</mrow></math>. Substituting <math alttext=\"negative 1\"><mrow>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mn>1</mn>\n</mrow></math> for <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi></math> in the first equation in the system, <math alttext=\"y equals 9 x plus 12\"><mrow>\n<mi>y</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mn>9</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n<mo>+</mo>\n<mn>12</mn>\n</mrow>\n</mrow></math>, yields <math alttext=\"y equals 9 left parenthesis negative 1 right parenthesis plus 12\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn></math>, or <math alttext=\"y equals 3\"><mrow>\n<mi>y</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>3</mn>\n</mrow></math>. Therefore, the value of <math alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi></math> is <math alttext=\"3\"><mn>3</mn></math>.</p>"
