    "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"3 y equals 4 x plus 17\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mn>3</mn>\n\t\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>4</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mn>17</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"minus 3 y equals 9 x minus 23\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mn>3</mn>\n\t\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>9</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mn>23</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The solution to the given system of equations is <math alttext=\"left parenthesis x comma y right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>. What is the value of <math alttext=\"39 x\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>39</mn>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow></math>?</p>",
