    "explanation": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is correct. Adding the second equation to the first equation in the given system of equations yields <math alttext=\"3 y minus 3 y equals 4 x plus 9 x plus 17 minus 23\"><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>17</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>23</mn></math>, or <math alttext=\"0 equals 13 x minus 6\"><mrow>\n<mn>0</mn>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mn>13</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mn>6</mn>\n</mrow>\n</mrow></math>. Adding <math alttext=\"6\"><mn>6</mn></math> to each side of this equation yields <math alttext=\"6 equals 13 x\"><mrow>\n<mn>6</mn>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mrow>\n<mn>13</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n</mrow></math>. Multiplying each side of this equation by <math alttext=\"3\"><mn>3</mn></math> yields <math alttext=\"18 equals 39 x\"><mrow>\n<mn>18</mn>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mrow>\n<mn>39</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n</mrow></math>. Therefore, the value of <math alttext=\"39 x\"><mrow>\n<mn>39</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow></math> is <math alttext=\"18\"><mn>18</mn></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext=\"minus 39 x\"><mrow>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mn>39</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow></math>, not <math alttext=\"39 x\"><mrow>\n<mn>39</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext=\"minus 13 x\"><mrow>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mn>13</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow></math>, not <math alttext=\"39 x\"><mrow>\n<mn>39</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext=\"13 x\"><mrow>\n<mn>13</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow></math>, not <math alttext=\"39 x\"><mrow>\n<mn>39</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow></math>.</p>",
