    "stem": "<p class=\"stem_paragraph \">The system of equations above has solution (<span class=\"italic\">x</span>, <span class=\"italic\">y</span>). What is the value of <span class=\"italic\">x</span> ?</p>",
    "type": "mcq",
    "correctAnswer": "D",
    "explanation": "<p>Choice D is correct. Adding the corresponding sides of the two equations eliminates <span class=\"italic\">y</span> and yields <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"x equals 6\"></span>, as shown.<p><span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"The equation one half y equals 4, added to the equation x minus one half y, equals 2, gives the equation x plus 0, equals 6\"></span></p><p>If (<span class=\"italic\">x</span>, <span class=\"italic\">y</span>) is a solution to the system, then (<span class=\"italic\">x</span>, <span class=\"italic\">y</span>) satisfies both equations in the system and any equation derived from them. Therefore, <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"x equals 6\"></span>.</p><p>Choices A, B, and C are incorrect and may be the result of errors when solving the system.</p><p> </p></p>",
    "passage": "<div class=\"stimulus_reference \" xmlns=\"http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/apip/apipv1p0/qtiitem/imsqti_v2p1\"><table class=\"table_Borderless\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"para_right tcp-5d4d032a-0e39-4647-bdb7-a6d885ca8ce5\"><span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"one half y equals 4\"></span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"para_right tcp-b5f1f72c-60c5-4986-ae97-7e09cfbdfad8\"><span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"x minus, one half y, equals 2\"></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
    "options": [
      {
        "id": "A",
        "text": "<p>3</p>"
      },
      {
        "id": "B",
        "text": "<p><span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"the fraction 7 over 2\"></span>&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;</p>"
      },
      {
        "id": "C",
        "text": "<p>4</p>"
      },
      {
        "id": "D",
        "text": "<p>6</p>"
      }
    ]
