    "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"y equals 7 x plus 18\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>7</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mn>18</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow></math></p>\n<p>One of the equations in a system of two linear equations is given. The system has no solution. Which equation could be the second equation in the system?</p>",
